WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.370
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:44.260
I don't care who you're in love with,
I want to get back together with you.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:47.560
I'll give you anything that you want.

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:52.600
Anything that I want?

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:57.760
Fine. In return,
you'll do what I ask you to?

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:04.880
"'The Destruction of Pure Love"'

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:12.850
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:18.690
She's a big fan of yours,
so she'll be fine with it.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:19.690
Even so...

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:22.600
Listen, I don't want
to ask this of you, either!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:25.030
But I don't have any alternative.

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:29.370
Recently, Momo-chan learned
that I was dating you,

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.370
and now she's really got it in for me.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:33.540
Then let me tell her that
if she does anything awful to you,

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.710
she'll have me to answer to.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:37.050
No, don't!

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.380
I'm really afraid of Momo-chan!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.720
If she sets out to get me,
I won't be able to stay in school!

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:47.390
But you want me to be with her,
even though I don't love her...

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:52.390
Right! I'm sorry! I'm sure
you'll hate me for this.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.730
I don't hate you...

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.070
Oh, good!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:02.670
But even now, who knows where
Momo-chan is watching me from?

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:06.340
So I have to keep on pretending
that I don't like you, Jigoro...

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.680
But the truth is I truly love you!

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.350
Do you really?

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.350
Mm-hmm.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:16.010
Then why don't we keep seeing each other,
but just not let her know about it?

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:24.030
I'm just so... tired...

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:30.620
All right. I'll spend the night with
that girl, if it'll make you feel better.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.970
Oh, l'd love to stay like this forever...

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.380
Adachi...

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:47.050
About your birthday party...

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:50.680
That night, my family
won't be home until late.

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:58.490
Will you come to my house that night?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.670
Jeez, I have no idea...

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:10.670
Sir? Can I help you?

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.670
Uh... No... I...

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.340
Kashiwagi!

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:20.680
A present for your lady?
May I suggest a cosmetic?

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.350
What are you doing here?

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.350
Don't look so wary!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:29.360
I'm just here to get a birthday
present for Momo-chan, too!

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.690
Here's an idea! Why don't
we go in together on a gift?

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:34.420
That way we can get her something nice!

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:39.730
No, I want to get her something myself.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.700
Of course...

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:47.380
Momo-chan would much prefer a present
that you picked out yourself, huh, Toji?

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.710
Okay, bye!

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:53.910
She was unusually light-hearted.
Maybe Kashiwagi had a change of heart.

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:00.050
Isn't that a lovely peach color?

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:01.990
Ah... Um... yeah.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:08.660
It's not so much pink as it is a soft peach.
And it's a sweet little bottle.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.130
Peach...

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.290
Try this.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.940
Isn't that nice? It's sweet
without being overpowering.

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:22.500
I'll take this!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.610
Thank you, sir.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.690
Excuse me!

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:32.480
I'll take this!

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:41.360
lt's finally come... the day is here...

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:44.420
That night, my family
won't be home until late.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:51.370
We'll be alone together until late. What am
l going to do if things start heating up?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.040
But this is my dependable Toji.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.530
Then again, Toji is a male!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:01.570
Oh! You're here! You're so late,
I thought you might be lost.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:09.660
A white turtle-neck, a checkered skirt,
knee socks and long boots...

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:12.060
I think I can do that
with stuff I already have.

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:18.390
l have to tell him! ''l think
we should go out for dinner...''

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.990
--Toji, I-
--Right! Adachi, close your eyes.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:30.680
D- don't tell me! Right here?!
I don't feel like it...

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:34.350
Huh? Oh, you don't feel like closing
your eyes? Then, I'll have to do this.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:37.020
W- what are you doing?!

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.350
Never mind! Just come in here!

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.320
Don't tell me he's just gonna...

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.960
Happy 16th Birthday.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.310
You did all of this yourself, Toji?

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.650
I couldn't come up with much, but...

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.650
Oh, that's not true.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.250
Good grief! What's wrong with me?
lmagining all those strange things!

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.810
l'm sorry, Toji!

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.120
Thank you, Toji!

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.670
It's darling.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.340
It reminded me perfectly of you, Adachi.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.340
How is this read?

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.340
Amour de Patou.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:35.010
"'Amour"' means "'love,"' right?

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.010
Uh-huh.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:42.020
Oh, this is the best birthday
a girl could ever have!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.680
May I try it on?

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:44.880
Of course.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:50.790
Amour...

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:55.030
That's no fair!
That's a surprise attack!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.370
I know I had a funny
expression on my face!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.700
What's wrong with that?!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.370
Here! Let me take a picture of you, Toji!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.970
Nuh-uh!

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:03.640
Give it to me!

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:07.270
Come on Toji, give it to me!

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:15.380
Saved it!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:25.280
Hello, Jigoro? It's me.

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:29.930
Yeah? Will you really do it for me?

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:47.350
Toji... the food'll get cold...

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:50.010
Who cares? We can heat it up later.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:55.020
l can't believe l was so
anxious about this. How silly.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:58.720
l mean, Toji's kisses
are so gentle and sweet...

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:11.600
I... I'm sorry! It's my cell phone.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:17.310
Who on earth is calling
at a time like this?!

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:20.650
--Hello?
--Help me, Momo-chan!

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.010
Sae?

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.650
You see...

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:26.990
Sae, are you crying?

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:31.660
He... Jigoro says he wants
to break up with me!

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:33.350
Huh?

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:51.680
Listen, Adachi, I really
think you'd better not go.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.510
But Sae was crying and all...

00:09:55.350 --> 00:10:01.090
I can't live without Jigoro! Momo-chan,
you're the only one I can depend on!

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:03.180
Please! Help me!

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:08.030
We've had lots of things between us,
but she seems to have changed.

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:10.360
And she is a friend, I guess.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.700
Then let me go with you.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:16.040
Well, she says she has things
she can only talk about with me.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.370
I see.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:20.710
I'm sorry! I'll go talk to her
and come right back.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.380
If it looks like it'll take longer,
I'll call you.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.380
Okay.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.350
So. I'll be back.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:37.060
Momo-chan!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:39.390
I'm sorry to ask this of you
today of all days.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:41.400
Mm-mm. Where's Jigoro?

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.360
He left...

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:46.400
But when I called him
and said that you were coming,

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.740
Momo-chan, he said he'd come back.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:50.740
Please, Momo-chan! Talk to Jigoro!

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:52.210
All right.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.350
Get in.

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:04.220
Please, Momo-chan! Persuade him!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.090
Please!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.700
H- hey, wait!

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:17.860
It's better, just the two of us.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.070
Just a minute, darling!
I'll be right there!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.210
Wha?

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.720
What's Momo-chan doing in his car?

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:02.440
And the offensive begins!

00:12:10.690 --> 00:12:12.880
Adachi's taking a long time.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.710
Adachi?

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:34.200
Jeez, don't startle me like that.

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:38.270
So? How'd it go with Kashiwagi?

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:46.720
What is this? What are we doing here?

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.850
Now, about Sae...

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:53.230
W- what are you doing?!

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:56.730
Come on! You said you wanted to see me!

00:12:56.730 --> 00:13:01.230
Get real! I never said that!
I'm outta here.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.740
What's going on here?

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.490
Adachi...

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.710
Huh? That ring tone...

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:54.050
Answer the phone, Sae!
What on earth is going on here?!

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:55.610
Adachi?

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.340
K- Kashiwagi!

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:10.340
Toji...

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.670
W- what...

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:15.010
What are you doing here?!

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:19.350
I love you! I truly do love you, Toji!
That's why...

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:20.680
Get away from me!

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:27.020
Shit!

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:30.420
I'm sorry, Adachi! I'm sorry!

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:34.700
Why doesn't Sae answer the phone?!

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.030
What do you want?

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:39.370
I want to talk to you.

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:43.130
I have nothing to talk to you about!
This is so stupid!

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.370
Hold it!

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.340
Yuck! Let go of me!

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:50.710
I said I want to talk to you.

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.710
What is this?!

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:54.050
Please let go of me!

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.240
Hey!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.990
I'm not gonna listen to your excuses.

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:04.660
Not even about why you're dressed
like that. All of that comes later.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.330
Right now, where's Adachi?

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:11.670
She went off with Jigoro.
Momo-chan's always been attracted to him.

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:15.000
You see, he's famous and rich!

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:18.010
Liar! Adachi's not like that!

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:22.070
Then phone her and see!
She should be with Jigoro.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:36.690
Who is it?

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.030
Adachi... Put Adachi on!

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.260
Sorry but she can't
come to the phone right now.

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:46.370
Well? It was just as I said, right?

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.700
Shut up!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:51.710
I don't believe that! The only one
I'll believe is Adachi!

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:54.710
Oh, Toji. You're too trusting.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:56.040
Come with me!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.380
With you?

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:03.580
To look for Adachi. You're the only one
who can contact this Jigoro guy.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:09.180
Enough! I can't run anymore!

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.000
--Toji? It's me, Kairi.
--Kairi!

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:21.340
Maybe I'm being overanxious about this,
but I just saw Momo-chan.

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:22.340
You saw Adachi?!

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:26.670
I saw her riding in a car
owned by that guy, Jigoro.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:30.340
Today's her birthday so I thought
it was a little strange.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.680
Has something happened?

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.150
I need to ask for your help!

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:36.340
Mm-hmm.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:44.350
What should I do?
Which way should I go?

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.370
Oh, no!

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:57.240
Don't come near me! If you come
any closer, you'll regret it!

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:02.030
Hey!

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.050
H- hey!

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.760
Hey, are you all right?!

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:27.670
Get real! You think saying
you don't know is good enough?

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:31.710
Come on! I really don't know anything!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:33.670
This is something Jigoro
is doing on his own.

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.340
Then why are you dressed like that?

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.010
Well, it's... um...

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:42.020
I thought maybe Toji was lonely,
since Momo-chan dropped him...

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:45.020
Yeah, that's it!
I thought I'd comfort him!

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:50.020
Enough! Just shut up!
And take that stuff off!

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:51.690
Oooo, what a meanie.

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:55.360
Anyway, his car was headed
towards the docks,

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:56.700
so we might as well go and see.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.700
This road is a dead-end, anyway.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:17:59.760
Yeah...

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.640
There's not a soul here...

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:09.640
Strange. I'm sure the car
was headed in this direction.

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:13.310
Kashiwagi, you know where
this Jigoro lives, don't you?

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:14.310
Yeah.

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:15.980
You're gonna show us even
if I have to kill you.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:35.000
Let's see... what number
was his apartment?

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:36.340
Kashiwagi!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:41.340
Okay, okay! I'll say I'm his little sister
and go ask the condo manager.

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:44.010
A good example of your cunning tricks.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.000
Humph!

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:01.560
Where am I?

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:13.960
What did you do to me?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.640
What did you do?!

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.470
I didn't...

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:24.910
Hey! Come on!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:25.690
"'Saving picture"'

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:28.680
Nice timing!

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:35.800
Oh, my! It seems that
Momo-chan is in Jigoro's apartment!

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.820
The condo manager saw them!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.720
We're going in!

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:47.030
Adachi!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.340
Toji?

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:59.310
Why you!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:13.700
Y- you know, I don't think it's a
good idea to punch a model in the face.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.220
Let him get punched.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:25.570
Sae-chan? What is all this about?

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.050
What do you mean?!
Jigoro, you're a monster!

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:32.710
What have you done to my good friend!

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:36.050
Sae-chan!

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:40.060
Adachi...

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:43.190
Why? Why would you do this?!

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:52.410
W- what?!

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.070
Sae-chan, you planned this, didn't you?

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.080
What are you talking about?

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.410
Is it true, Sae?!

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:01.010
N- no! I didn't do anything.

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:04.350
This is so awful! I thought
you were my friend.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:07.020
No! I think of you
the same way, Momo-chan.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:09.020
Enough!

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:13.030
Get out! Get out of my sight!

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:17.360
H- how dare you!
And after I came to rescue you!

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:22.040
Although it probably wasn't right
for Toji and me to kiss, but...

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:25.040
Kiss? You kissed Toji?

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:27.030
That's not true, is it, Toji?

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:30.510
Don't tell me...

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:41.120
Come on, you two.
You have to talk it over.

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:48.730
l'm sorry, Toji. l have
no right to criticize you.

00:21:48.730 --> 00:21:51.060
After what surely happened
between Jigoro and me...

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:52.730
I'm sorry, Adachi...

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:56.740
If only I had gone with you...

00:21:56.740 --> 00:22:00.070
Why? Why did this have to happen to us?

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:01.010
Adachi...

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:03.680
It's all over between us.

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:05.350
No, it isn't!

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:07.400
But I'm not a...

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:12.350
You don't have to say a word!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:15.690
You haven't done anything wrong, Adachi.
You haven't changed at all.

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:18.030
Adachi, you are still you.

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:19.150
Toji...

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:28.040
That Sae-chan!

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:29.160
Time for revenge!

00:22:36.850 --> 00:22:43.180
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:52.860
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.860
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:02.470
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:08.810
Where can we go

00:23:08.810 --> 00:23:18.490
where we can all be

00:23:18.490 --> 00:23:20.820
under the same sky?

00:23:20.820 --> 00:23:29.500
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:35.840
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:42.510
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.510 --> 00:23:49.520
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:57.860
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:04.470
What?! What makes you think
l'm inferior to Momo-chan?!

00:24:04.470 --> 00:24:06.800
Always putting other people down!

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:09.800
Whatever l can't get my hands on,
l'll break!

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:13.140
Next time on Peach Girl, "'Peach Crisis"'
